{"lines": [{"text": "Oil gets cheaper, so why is the pump price still high a week later?", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.104, "spec": null, "words": [["Oil", 0.068, 0.227], ["gets", 0.227, 0.364], ["cheaper", 0.375, 0.818], ["so", 1.159, 1.307], ["why", 1.307, 1.477], ["is", 1.489, 1.568], ["the", 1.568, 1.659], ["pump", 1.659, 1.909], ["price", 1.909, 2.239], ["still", 2.25, 2.432], ["high", 2.432, 2.568], ["a", 2.568, 2.636], ["week", 2.636, 2.818], ["later", 2.818, 3.159]]}, {"text": "Economists even have a name for it: rockets and feathers.", "start": 4.354, "end": 8.194, "spec": null, "words": [["Economists", 0.08, 0.636], ["even", 0.75, 0.92], ["have", 0.92, 1.045], ["a", 1.045, 1.08], ["name", 1.08, 1.341], ["for", 1.341, 1.591], ["it", 1.591, 1.693], ["rockets", 2.148, 2.727], ["and", 2.739, 2.807], ["feathers", 2.807, 3.5]]}, {"text": "Prices shoot up like a rocket, and drift down like a feather.", "start": 8.444, "end": 11.9, "spec": null, "words": [["Prices", 0.102, 0.42], ["shoot", 0.432, 0.67], ["up", 0.67, 0.841], ["like", 0.852, 0.955], ["a", 0.955, 1.0], ["rocket", 1.011, 1.5], ["and", 1.841, 1.909], ["drift", 1.92, 2.205], ["down", 2.205, 2.443], ["like", 2.443, 2.557], ["a", 2.557, 2.591], ["feather", 2.602, 3.125]]}, {"text": "Crude oil is roughly half of what you pay for a gallon.", "start": 12.15, "end": 15.27, "spec": null, "words": [["Crude", 0.091, 0.318], ["oil", 0.318, 0.614], ["is", 0.716, 0.875], ["roughly", 0.886, 1.295], ["half", 1.307, 1.693], ["of", 1.693, 1.773], ["what", 1.773, 1.886], ["you", 1.886, 1.966], ["pay", 1.977, 2.261], ["for", 2.273, 2.409], ["a", 2.409, 2.443], ["gallon", 2.443, 2.795]]}, {"text": "A ten dollar jump per barrel adds about twenty-five cents per gallon.", "start": 15.52, "end": 19.336, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.125], ["ten", 0.125, 0.295], ["dollar", 0.295, 0.545], ["jump", 0.545, 0.909], ["per", 1.023, 1.25], ["barrel", 1.261, 1.67], ["adds", 1.67, 1.955], ["about", 1.966, 2.216], ["twenty-five", 2.216, 2.807], ["cents", 2.807, 3.045], ["per", 3.045, 3.159], ["gallon", 3.17, 3.489]]}, {"text": "When oil rises, stations raise prices fast, because their thin margin disappears overnight.", "start": 19.586, "end": 25.49, "spec": null, "words": [["When", 0.091, 0.239], ["oil", 0.25, 0.557], ["rises", 0.557, 1.102], ["stations", 1.273, 1.784], ["raise", 1.795, 2.216], ["prices", 2.227, 2.693], ["fast", 2.705, 3.182], ["because", 3.193, 3.477], ["their", 3.477, 3.614], ["thin", 3.625, 3.966], ["margin", 3.966, 4.318], ["disappears", 4.318, 5.045], ["overnight", 5.057, 5.568]]}, {"text": "When costs fall, nobody is in a hurry.", "start": 25.74, "end": 28.332, "spec": null, "words": [["When", 0.08, 0.17], ["costs", 0.17, 0.523], ["fall", 0.523, 0.818], ["nobody", 1.205, 1.648], ["is", 1.659, 1.761], ["in", 1.761, 1.83], ["a", 1.841, 1.864], ["hurry", 1.864, 2.239]]}, {"text": "Studies find prices typically fall about twice as slowly as they rose.", "start": 28.582, "end": 33.094, "spec": null, "words": [["Studies", 0.091, 0.386], ["find", 0.386, 0.682], ["prices", 0.693, 1.239], ["typically", 1.409, 1.818], ["fall", 1.83, 2.17], ["about", 2.17, 2.398], ["twice", 2.398, 2.852], ["as", 2.864, 2.977], ["slowly", 2.989, 3.523], ["as", 3.534, 3.614], ["they", 3.625, 3.716], ["rose", 3.716, 4.182]]}, {"text": "One reason is you.", "start": 33.344, "end": 35.216, "spec": null, "words": [["One", 0.091, 0.261], ["reason", 0.261, 0.523], ["is", 0.534, 0.648], ["you", 0.648, 0.898]]}, {"text": "When prices climb, drivers hunt for the cheapest station, so stations must keep up.", "start": 35.466, "end": 40.362, "spec": null, "words": [["When", 0.08, 0.17], ["prices", 0.17, 0.58], ["climb", 0.591, 1.023], ["drivers", 1.364, 1.705], ["hunt", 1.705, 1.943], ["for", 1.943, 2.023], ["the", 2.023, 2.091], ["cheapest", 2.102, 2.443], ["station", 2.443, 2.852], ["so", 3.182, 3.33], ["stations", 3.33, 3.886], ["must", 3.886, 4.114], ["keep", 4.114, 4.318], ["up", 4.318, 4.557]]}, {"text": "When prices drop, most of us stop comparing, and stations enjoy fatter margins for a few weeks.", "start": 40.612, "end": 46.42, "spec": null, "words": [["When", 0.091, 0.182], ["prices", 0.193, 0.591], ["drop", 0.591, 0.977], ["most", 1.432, 1.75], ["of", 1.761, 1.818], ["us", 1.818, 1.966], ["stop", 1.977, 2.284], ["comparing", 2.284, 2.83], ["and", 3.08, 3.17], ["stations", 3.17, 3.625], ["enjoy", 3.625, 3.977], ["fatter", 3.977, 4.295], ["margins", 4.307, 4.659], ["for", 4.659, 4.773], ["a", 4.773, 4.807], ["few", 4.807, 5.011], ["weeks", 5.011, 5.455]]}, {"text": "Nobody wants to cut first either, because rivals would just match the price.", "start": 46.67, "end": 51.038, "spec": null, "words": [["Nobody", 0.08, 0.341], ["wants", 0.341, 0.523], ["to", 0.523, 0.591], ["cut", 0.591, 0.795], ["first", 0.795, 1.17], ["either", 1.182, 1.455], ["because", 1.67, 2.023], ["rivals", 2.034, 2.42], ["would", 2.42, 2.568], ["just", 2.568, 2.92], ["match", 2.932, 3.318], ["the", 3.318, 3.398], ["price", 3.409, 4.034]]}, {"text": "After a couple of months it usually evens out, but those weeks add up.", "start": 51.288, "end": 54.576, "spec": null, "words": [["After", 0.091, 0.273], ["a", 0.284, 0.318], ["couple", 0.318, 0.534], ["of", 0.534, 0.591], ["months", 0.591, 0.909], ["it", 0.92, 1.023], ["usually", 1.034, 1.375], ["evens", 1.375, 1.614], ["out", 1.614, 1.841], ["but", 1.852, 1.977], ["those", 1.977, 2.205], ["weeks", 2.205, 2.523], ["add", 2.534, 2.693], ["up", 2.693, 2.943]]}, {"text": "So when oil drops, keep checking prices, because shopping around speeds up the feather.", "start": 54.826, "end": 60.01, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.216], ["when", 0.227, 0.352], ["oil", 0.352, 0.58], ["drops", 0.58, 1.159], ["keep", 1.352, 1.545], ["checking", 1.557, 1.852], ["prices", 1.852, 2.386], ["because", 2.534, 2.852], ["shopping", 2.864, 3.284], ["around", 3.284, 3.58], ["speeds", 3.58, 4.193], ["up", 4.193, 4.284], ["the", 4.284, 4.352], ["feather", 4.364, 4.83]]}, {"text": "Do you check gas prices before you fill up, or just pull in?", "start": 60.26, "end": 63.308, "spec": null, "words": [["Do", 0.091, 0.125], ["you", 0.125, 0.193], ["check", 0.193, 0.386], ["gas", 0.386, 0.614], ["prices", 0.614, 0.92], ["before", 0.932, 1.148], ["you", 1.159, 1.227], ["fill", 1.227, 1.443], ["up", 1.455, 1.614], ["or", 1.807, 2.011], ["just", 2.17, 2.318], ["pull", 2.318, 2.568], ["in", 2.58, 2.727]]}], "dur": 65.11}